@startuml docs/security/video-generation-auth.puml
title "Video Generation API — Authenticated & Owner-Scoped"

actor User
participant "Browser"
participant "React Component"
participant "API Route (/api/video/*)"
participant "Rate Limiter"
database "Job Store (memory)"
participant "External" as Mastra

== Nominal Case: start generation (202) ==
User ->> Browser: Click "Generate"
Browser ->> "React Component": handleGenerate()
"React Component" ->> "API Route (/api/video/*)": POST /api/video/generate {content, format, style}
note right of "API Route (/api/video/*)": requireViewer()\n(session + active org)
"API Route (/api/video/*)" ->> "Rate Limiter": ai:video:{userId} (5 / 10 min)
"Rate Limiter" -->> "API Route (/api/video/*)": success
note right of "API Route (/api/video/*)": Zod videoGenerationSchema
"API Route (/api/video/*)" ->> "Job Store (memory)": createJob(request, ownerId = userId)
"API Route (/api/video/*)" ->> Mastra: videoGenerationWorkflow.execute() (background)
"API Route (/api/video/*)" -->> "React Component": 202 {jobId}

== Nominal Case: poll status (200) ==
"React Component" ->> "API Route (/api/video/*)": GET /api/video/status/{jobId}
note right of "API Route (/api/video/*)": requireViewer()
"API Route (/api/video/*)" ->> "Job Store (memory)": getJobForOwner(jobId, userId)
"Job Store (memory)" -->> "API Route (/api/video/*)": job
"API Route (/api/video/*)" -->> "React Component": 200 {status, progress}

== Edge Case: Unauthorized (401) ==
note right of "API Route (/api/video/*)": No session
"API Route (/api/video/*)" -->> "React Component": 401 Unauthorized
"React Component" ->> Browser: toast error

== Edge Case: Too many generations (429) ==
"Rate Limiter" -->> "API Route (/api/video/*)": limit exceeded
"API Route (/api/video/*)" -->> "React Component": 429 + Retry-After

== Edge Case: Another user's job (404) ==
note right of "Job Store (memory)": ownerId != userId\nreads as missing
"API Route (/api/video/*)" -->> "React Component": 404 Job not found

== Edge Case: Invalid Input (400) ==
note right of "API Route (/api/video/*)": ZodError
"API Route (/api/video/*)" -->> "React Component": 400 {error}

== Chat: history scoped per user ==
"React Component" ->> "API Route (/api/video/*)": POST /api/video/chat {message, sessionId}
note right of "API Route (/api/video/*)": requireViewer() + ai:videoChat:{userId}\nkey = userId:sessionId
@enduml
